{{apichanges|10.0.7|prev=10.0.5|next=10.1.0}}

==Summary==
* A new <code>advflyable</code> macro conditional has been added, with a corresponding {{api|t=a|IsAdvancedFlyableArea()}} function also made available to the restricted environment.
* The client now supports loading PNG texture assets through {{api|t=w|TextureBase:SetTexture()}}.

