* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/10.0.5..10.0.7 wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/compare/10.0.5..10.0.7 BlizzardInterfaceResources]
* Official patch notes: [https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/23923813/dragonflight-1007-content-update-notes-now-live#item19 Dragonflight: 10.0.7 Content Update Notes]

